# Optional play-only overrides for MarlothStrategy.Console.App.
# Copy to `.env` in the repo root (gitignored). Missing `.env` = production play behavior.
#
# Loaded only by the console App (not by tests). Unset keys must keep production defaults.
# When adding a key, document its production default here and treat unset as that value.
#
# SCENARIO_PRESET — named preset under config/scenarios/{name}.json.
# Production default: unset → generate a random scenario (essential graph ± testing/merge, 2–4 pool actors).
# Example: SCENARIO_PRESET=lab01
# SCENARIO_PRESET=

# SCENARIO_SEED — integer RNG seed for random scenario generation (also shown on the status header).
# Production default: unset → a random seed is chosen at boot.
# Example: SCENARIO_SEED=12345
# SCENARIO_SEED=
